    ManualVersionSuffix: 
    Added: 'Colony panel with statistics and settings

      Storage rooms for food,
      building material, water, sand and mushrooms

      Aphid farm with the new
      farmer ant: milked aphids give sand, leaves, water and sometimes a glowing
      mushroom

      Termites can bite aphids into black aphids that attack your
      ants

      Upgrades bought with nutrients and the colony dependency tree

      New
      ants: the spitter, a ranged warrior, and the waste keeper

      Guard posts
      for soldiers during raids

      Waste area modes: turn leaves into water,
      or dirt into sand and water

      Paint limit for each room type, with area
      upgrades and a free-area bar

      Built rooms change their look as the ants
      plaster them

      Deeper lakes and underground water pockets

      Spatial
      audio: sounds follow the camera position and zoom

      New lighting: light
      comes in only from outside, tunnels are dim and have a textured back wall

      The
      build version now shows in the bottom-right corner of every screen

      Click
      the version to see every release so far and its notes

      A short interface
      tour opens every new game: it explains the cards, menus and buttons, and you
      can click anything along the way

      The Colony menu on the left tucks away until the mouse gets close

      New glossary explaining every part of the game, with pictures, opened by the
      ? button or the ESC menu'
    Removed: Speed buttons (pause stays)
    Modified: 'Dew drops every 4 s (was 8 s)

      Raids every 2 to 10 minutes,
      with swarms of 20% to 50% of your ants

      Ants without a job help as workers

      Carriers
      take more of every item and fill the storage first

      The nutrient room
      fetches leaves and water from storage

      Ants walk over blocks built outside

      New
      look for the ants, queen, termites, brood, aphids and pebbles

      Evolution
      nodes show only icons, and the bottom bar fits in a single card with a Show
      rooms option

      Smoother raids with many ants and termites'
    KnownBugs: 
    ChangelogTranslations:
    - LanguageCode: pt-BR
      Added: "Painel da col\xF4nia com estat\xEDsticas e configura\xE7\xF5es\nDep\xF3sitos
        de alimentos, material de constru\xE7\xE3o, \xE1gua, areia e cogumelos\nFazenda
        de pulg\xF5es com a nova formiga fazendeira: pulg\xF5es ordenhados d\xE3o
        areia, folhas, \xE1gua e \xE0s vezes um cogumelo luminoso\nCupins podem morder
        pulg\xF5es e transform\xE1-los em pulg\xF5es pretos que atacam as formigas\nMelhorias
        compradas com nutrientes e o formigueiro de depend\xEAncias\nNovas formigas:
        a cuspideira, guerreira de ataque a dist\xE2ncia, e a lixeira\nPostos de
        guarda para as soldadas durante os ataques\nModos da \xE1rea de res\xEDduos:
        folhas viram \xE1gua, ou terra vira areia e \xE1gua\nLimite de pintura por
        tipo de sala, com melhorias de \xE1rea e barra de \xE1rea livre\nSalas constru\xEDdas
        mudam de visual enquanto as formigas as rebocam\nLagos mais fundos e bols\xF5es
        de \xE1gua no subterr\xE2neo\n\xC1udio espacial: os sons acompanham a posi\xE7\xE3o
        e o zoom da c\xE2mera\nNova ilumina\xE7\xE3o: a luz s\xF3 entra pelo lado
        de fora, os t\xFAneis ficam na penumbra e t\xEAm parede de fundo com textura\nA
        vers\xE3o da build aparece no canto inferior direito de todas as telas\nClique
        na vers\xE3o para ver todas as vers\xF5es at\xE9 agora e as notas de cada
        uma\nUm tour curto da interface abre todo jogo novo: explica os cart\xF5es,
        os menus e os bot\xF5es, e voc\xEA pode clicar em tudo durante ele\nO menu Col\xF4nia, \xE0 esquerda, fica recolhido at\xE9 o mouse chegar perto\nNovo gloss\xE1rio com a explica\xE7\xE3o de cada parte do jogo, com imagens, aberto pelo bot\xE3o ? ou pelo menu do ESC"
      Removed: "Bot\xF5es de velocidade (a pausa continua)"
      Modified: "Gota de orvalho a cada 4 s (era 8 s)\nAtaques a cada 2 a 10 minutos,
        com enxames de 20% a 50% das formigas\nFormigas sem trabalho ajudam como
        oper\xE1rias\nCarregadoras levam mais de todos os itens e enchem o estoque
        primeiro\nA sala de nutrientes busca folhas e \xE1gua nos dep\xF3sitos\nAs
        formigas andam sobre os blocos constru\xEDdos do lado de fora\nNova apar\xEAncia
        das formigas, rainha, cupins, crias, pulg\xF5es e pedrinhas\nOs n\xF3s da
        Evolu\xE7\xE3o mostram s\xF3 \xEDcones, e a barra inferior cabe num cart\xE3o
        s\xF3, com a op\xE7\xE3o Mostrar ambientes\nAtaques mais leves com muitas
        formigas e cupins"
      KnownBugs: 
