  runtimeChangelog:
  - VersionLabel: v0.1.0
    Timestamp: 2026-10-18 2347
    MajorVersion: 0
    MinorVersion: 1
    PatchVersion: 0
    Suffix: 
    Profile: Development
    BuildProfileId: 
    BuildProfileName: 
    Added: 'Living ant farm: dig tunnels and rooms with the brush; dirt falls and
      piles up grain by grain

      Procedural map that grows with the camera, with
      surface scenery and parallax

      Rain and water: ponds, light rain that
      dissolves dumped dirt, heavy rain that packs it, erosion and drowning

      The
      queen and her room: she lays eggs that workers carry to the nursery

      Brood
      cycle in the nursery: egg, larva and pupa

      Ant roles: carrier, leafcutter,
      digger, gardener and nurse, each with its own look; the colony starts with
      one gardener

      Nutrient room: harvest surface plants and grow nutrients
      with soft soil, plants and water; nutrients are the currency

      Queen tree
      on the Evolution screen: choose which ant to raise and unlock classes and upgrades

      Termite
      raids once the colony reaches 15 ants: flying termites land, lose their wings
      and wreck brood, beds and walls

      Soldier ants hunt termites, and the
      waste area breaks down what is left

      Dew Drops room

      Recall bell
      to call the ants back

      Ants walk freely outside the nest and can build
      there

      Speed up to 8x

      Main menu with the colony working in the
      background, ESC menu, settings, save and load

      Tutorial on the first
      launch and a game over screen

      Feedback effects on actions'
    Removed: 
    Modified: 'Ants no longer die by default

      Only one ant goes after each
      grain of dirt, no more crowds going back and forth

      Smoother play with
      hundreds of ants'
    KnownBugs: 
    LanguageCode: en
    Translations:
    - LanguageCode: pt-BR
      Added: "Formig\xE1rio vivo: cave t\xFAneis e salas com o pincel; a terra cai
        e se acumula gr\xE3o a gr\xE3o\nMapa procedural que cresce com a c\xE2mera,
        com cen\xE1rio na superf\xEDcie e paralaxe\nChuva e \xE1gua: laguinhos, chuva
        leve que dissolve a terra despejada, chuva forte que a compacta, eros\xE3o
        e afogamento\nA rainha e a sala dela: ela p\xF5e ovos que as oper\xE1rias
        levam ao ber\xE7\xE1rio\nCiclo de cria\xE7\xE3o no ber\xE7\xE1rio: ovo, larva
        e pupa\nPap\xE9is das formigas: carregadora, cortadeira, escavadora, jardineira
        e cuidadora, cada uma com sua apar\xEAncia; a col\xF4nia come\xE7a com uma
        jardineira\nSala de nutrientes: colha plantas da superf\xEDcie e cultive
        nutrientes com terra fofa, plantas e \xE1gua; nutrientes s\xE3o a moeda\n\xC1rvore
        da rainha na tela de Evolu\xE7\xE3o: escolha qual formiga criar e libere
        classes e melhorias\nAtaques de cupins quando a col\xF4nia chega a 15 formigas:
        cupins voam, pousam, perdem as asas e destroem crias, canteiros e paredes\nSoldadas
        ca\xE7am os cupins, e a \xE1rea de res\xEDduos decomp\xF5e o que sobra\nSala
        Gotas de Orvalho\nSino de recolhimento para chamar as formigas de volta\nAs
        formigas andam livres do lado de fora e podem construir l\xE1\nVelocidade
        at\xE9 8x\nMenu principal com a col\xF4nia trabalhando ao fundo, menu do
        ESC, configura\xE7\xF5es, salvar e carregar\nTutorial na primeira abertura
        e tela de game over\nEfeitos de resposta \xE0s a\xE7\xF5es"
      Removed: 
      Modified: "As formigas n\xE3o morrem mais por padr\xE3o\nS\xF3 uma formiga
        vai atr\xE1s de cada gr\xE3o de terra, sem bando indo e voltando\nJogo mais
        leve com centenas de formigas"
      KnownBugs: 
